    {
      "id": "CanalaveCityHarborInn_Text_TheseWordsWereHeard",
      "en_US": [
        "Though fading out of consciousness,\n",
        "these words were heard...\r",
        "???: DARKRAI...\n",
        "Your power is strong.\r",
        "Though you do not wish it, you cause\n",
        "people and Pokémon around you to see\f",
        "deeply disturbing dreams...\r",
        "There is a place right for you.\r",
        "Newmoon Island...\n",
        "You will be alone there.\r",
        "There is no one there to see the\n",
        "dreadful dreams you bring.\r",
        "If someone does, Fullmoon Island is\n",
        "nearby...\r",
        "...\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Aux marges de la conscience, ces mots\n",
        "se font entendre...\r",
        "???: DARKRAI...\n",
        "Grand est ton pouvoir.\r",
        "Sans le vouloir, tu plonges les gens et\n",
        "les Pokémon qui te côtoient dans\f",
        "d’affreux cauchemars...\r",
        "Il existe un endroit qui t’est destiné.\r",
        "L’Ile Nouvellune...\n",
        "Là-bas, tu seras seul.\r",
        "Il n’y aura personne pour subir tes\n",
        "rêves effrayants.\r",
        "Et si jamais cela devait se produire,\n",
        "l’Ile Pleine Lune est proche...\r",
        "...\r"
      ]
    },
